          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo oye koppere; kare ame gin owinyo ni Rwot doŋ olimo jo Icrael, dok daŋ neno can luŋ ame Icrael tye ka neno, gin luŋ ote kulo wigi piny woro Obaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
